sequenceDiagram
  participant U as 用户态
  participant TV as uservec / trapframe
  participant K as usertrap / syscall
  participant VM as walkaddr + copyin/out
  participant IO as UART/内核缓冲
  U->>TV: ecall，保存现场
  TV->>K: 切换 kernel satp，stvec=kernelvec
  K->>VM: 校验 V/U/W，逐页分段拷贝
  VM->>IO: 访问受控内核缓冲或外设
  IO-->>VM: 结果
  VM-->>K: 返回长度或 -1
  K->>TV: stvec=uservec，a0=satp
  TV-->>U: userret + sret
